1
00:00:00,858 --> 00:00:02,278
(Raj:)But she did dump you.

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:07,200
(Howard:)Grow up, Raj.
There's no place for truth on the Internet.

3
00:00:09,533 --> 00:00:11,993
(Howard:)Just go. I'll catch up with you.

4
00:00:12,161 --> 00:00:14,041
All right.

5
00:00:14,204 --> 00:00:16,664
(Raj:)We should have a plan
in case one of us gets lucky.

6
00:00:19,668 --> 00:00:20,958
(Leonard:)Okay, uh...

7
00:00:21,128 --> 00:00:24,628
(Leonard:)If I get lucky, I'll take her to my stately
manor outside Gotham City...

8
00:00:24,798 --> 00:00:29,638
(Leonard:)...and if you get lucky,
I'll sleep on the moon.

9
00:00:30,387 --> 00:00:32,217
(Raj:)Sounds like a plan.

10
00:00:34,057 --> 00:00:37,057
(Penny:)Hang on, I think the emergency key
is around here somewhere.

11
00:00:37,227 --> 00:00:39,517
(Sheldon:)We have a bowl.

12
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:42,230
(Sheldon:)Our keys go in a bowl.

13
00:00:42,399 --> 00:00:44,529
(Sheldon:)You should get a bowl.

14
00:00:44,943 --> 00:00:48,993
(Penny:)So how did the beautiful mind of Sheldon
Cooper forget his key in the first place?

15
00:00:49,948 --> 00:00:52,238
(Sheldon:)I left them in the bowl.

16
00:00:52,993 --> 00:00:55,413
Uh-oh. I remembered
where the emergency key is.

17
00:00:55,579 --> 00:00:57,579
- Where?
- In your apartment.

18
00:00:57,748 --> 00:00:59,248
(Sheldon:)What's it doing in my apartment?

19
00:00:59,416 --> 00:01:02,796
(Penny:)I went in there a few weeks ago,
and you guys weren't home, and I forgot it.

